            "name": "Bill Inquiry",
            "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                    {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json",
                        "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                        "key": "username",
                        "value": "{{kuickpay_username}}",
                        "type": "text",
                        "description": "Merchant username provided by Kuickpay"
                    },
                    {
                        "key": "password",
                        "value": "{{kuickpay_password}}",
                        "type": "text",
                        "description": "Merchant password provided by Kuickpay"
                    }
                ],
                "body": {
                    "mode": "raw",
                    "raw": "{\n  \"consumer_number\": \"0000812345\",\n  \"bank_mnemonic\": \"KPY\",\n  \"reserved\": \"03000000000 | abc@abc.com\"\n}",
                    "options": {
                        "raw": {
                            "language": "json"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "url": {
                    "raw": "{{kuickpay_base_url}}/api/v1/BillInquiry",
                    "host": [
                        "{{kuickpay_base_url}}"
                    ],
                    "path": [
                        "api",
                        "v1",
                        "BillInquiry"
                    ]
                },
                "description": "Query bill information from Kuickpay.\n\n**Request Headers:**\n- `username`: Merchant username\n- `password`: Merchant password\n- `Content-Type`: application/json\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `consumer_number` (string, required): Consumer/utility account number (18 digits)\n  - First 5 digits = Kuickpay Prefix assigned by Kuickpay\n  - Example: 015209898740 (01520 = prefix)\n- `bank_mnemonic` (string, required): Bank identifier (max 8 chars)\n- `reserved` (string, optional): Pipe-separated data (contact | email)\n\n**Bill Status Codes:**\n- 'U' = Unpaid voucher (payment allowed)\n- 'P' = Paid voucher (no further payment)\n- 'B' = Blocked voucher\n- 'T' = Valid top-up voucher"
            },
            "response": [
                {
                    "name": "Success - Unpaid Voucher",
                    "originalRequest": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "username",
                                "value": "Test"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "password",
                                "value": "@bcd"
                            }
