        {
            "name": "Bill Payment",
            "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                    {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json",
                        "type": "text"
                    },
                    {
                        "key": "username",
                        "value": "{{kuickpay_username}}",
                        "type": "text",
                        "description": "Merchant username provided by Kuickpay"
                    },
                    {
                        "key": "password",
                        "value": "{{kuickpay_password}}",
                        "type": "text",
                        "description": "Merchant password provided by Kuickpay"
                    }
                ],
                "body": {
                    "mode": "raw",
                    "raw": "{\n  \"consumer_number\": \"0000812345\",\n  \"tran_auth_id\": \"112233\",\n  \"transaction_amount\": \"1869.00\",\n  \"tran_date\": \"20260109\",\n  \"tran_time\": \"161230\",\n  \"bank_mnemonic\": \"KPY\",\n  \"reserved\": \"\"\n}",
                    "options": {
                        "raw": {
                            "language": "json"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "url": {
                    "raw": "{{kuickpay_base_url}}/api/v1/BillPayment",
                    "host": [
                        "{{kuickpay_base_url}}"
                    ],
                    "path": [
                        "api",
                        "v1",
                        "BillPayment"
                    ]
                },
                "description": "Process bill payment through Kuickpay.\n\n**Request Headers:**\n- `username`: Merchant username\n- `password`: Merchant password\n- `Content-Type`: application/json\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `consumer_number` (string, required): Consumer/utility account number (18 digits)\n- `tran_auth_id` (string, required): Transaction authorization ID (6 digits, unique per date)\n- `transaction_amount` (string, required): Amount as plain number string (e.g., \"1869.00\")\n  - **Note:** SAER.PK backend automatically converts this to AN14 format before sending to Kuickpay\n  - AN14 Format: +0000000186900 (sign + 13 digits, last 2 are minor units)\n- `tran_date` (string, required): Transaction date in YYYYMMDD format\n- `tran_time` (string, required): Transaction time in HHMMSS format\n- `bank_mnemonic` (string, required): Bank identifier (max 8 chars)\n- `reserved` (string, optional): Reserved field (max 200 chars)\n\n**Important:**\n- Transaction Auth ID must be unique within the same date\n- Can be repeated on next date\n- If Kuickpay charges are passed to consumer, include in amount"
            },
            "response": [
                {
                    "name": "Success Response",
                    "originalRequest": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                            {
                                "key": "Content-Type",
                                "value": "application/json"
                            },
                            {
                                "key": "username",
                                "value": "Test"
                            },
